.ENDS

************************************************************************
* Library Name: sg13cmos5l_io
* Cell Name:    sg13cmos5l_IOPadIOVss
* View Name:    schematic
************************************************************************

.SUBCKT sg13cmos5l_IOPadIOVss vdd vss iovdd iovss
*.PININFO iovdd:B iovss:B vdd:B vss:B
